      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a solid list for the pro-consumer side. I also need to address the pushback from the big tech companies so the episode doesn't feel one-sided. They usually argue that these laws threaten their intellectual property and security. In your view, are those just excuses to keep their monopolies, or is there actually a legitimate point to their argument about IP rights?",
